{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"plantuml","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"PlantUML","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PlantUML (.puml .plantuml .wsd .iuml).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"plantuml","name":"PlantUML","extensions":[".puml",".plantuml",".wsd",".iuml",".pu"],"grammar":"grammars/plantuml.json","lineComment":"'","blockComment":["/'","'/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"PlantUML","path":"snippets/plantuml.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/plantuml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/'\",\n      \"end\": \"'\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*@(?:start|end)[a-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<<[^>]*>>\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[-.=]+(?:[ox]|>>?|\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\|//)?[a-z]*[-.=]*>>?|<<?[-.=]+|--+|\\\\.\\\\.+|<\\\\|--|--\\\\|>\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"![A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}|#[A-Za-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:participant|collections|annotation|deactivate|interface|component|rectangle|skinparam|namespace|boundary|database|abstract|endwhile|activate|control|usecase|package|destroy|entity|folder|bottom|elseif|repeat|legend|header|footer|object|actor|queue|class|cloud|frame|right|title|endif|while|start|group|state|enum|node|note|over|left|else|stop|loop|hide|show|fork|join|end|top|alt|opt|par|box|map|of|as|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/plantuml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Diagram\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"uml\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@startuml\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"@enduml\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A diagram\"\n  },\n  \"Sequence\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"seq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:Alice} -> ${2:Bob}: ${3:Hello}\",\n      \"${2:Bob} --> ${1:Alice}: ${4:Hi}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A message\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"  +${2:field}: ${3:String}\",\n      \"  +${4:method}()\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"comp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[${1:Component}] --> [${2:Other}]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A component\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# PlantUML\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for PlantUML.\n\n## Files\n\n`.puml`, `.plantuml`, `.wsd`, `.iuml`, `.pu`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `'`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `uml` | A diagram |\n| `seq` | A message |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `comp` | A component |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}